刺史檀和之至豫章，討平之。誕世兄車騎參軍新興太守景世、景世弟寶世，詣廷尉歸罪，並徙遠州。乾秀奪國。世祖初，徙者並得還。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household:p001:m0096","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household:p001:m0021","source_term":"藩第十六子誕世"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"原文明十六子。"}},{"id":"otw_1ui_wba_E","label":"胡景世（誕世兄）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"景世","mention_ids":["c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household:p001:m0164","c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household:p001:m0167","c-songshu-050-hujingbao:p001:m0011","c-songshu-050-hujingbao:p001:m0014"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household:p001:m0164","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household","quote":"景世"},{"mention_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household:p001:m0167","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household","quote":"景世"},{"mention_id":"c-songshu-050-hujingbao:p001:m0011","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-050-hujingbao:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-050-hujingbao","quote":"景世"},{"mention_id":"c-songshu-050-hujingbao:p001:m0014","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-050-hujingbao:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-050-hujingbao","quote":"景世"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"胡景世（誕世兄），見本組原文及身份互校。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"otw_1ui_wba","source_assertion_id":null,"parent_connection":{"type":"shared_father_through_siblings","sibling_assertion_ids":["a-song050-danshi-jingshi"],"sibling_father_assertion_id":"a-song050-danshi-fan"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-050","chapter_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household","source_id":"s-songshu-050-hu-fan-household-ws2371899","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household:p001","quote":"子隆世嗣，官至西陽太守。隆世卒，子乾秀嗣。藩庶子六十人，多不遵法度。藩第十四子遵世，為臧質寧遠參軍，去職還家，與孔熙先同逆謀，太祖以藩功臣，不欲顯其事，使江州以他事收殺之。二十四年，藩第十六子誕世、第十七子茂世率羣從二百餘人攻破郡縣，殺太守桓隆之、令諸葛和之，欲奉庶人義康。值交州刺史檀