gshu-050-hujingbao-ws2371899"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-song050-danshi-jingshi","subject_person_id":"otw_1ui_wba_C","object_person_id":"otw_1ui_wba_E","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"誕世兄車騎參軍新興太守景世","relative_birth_order":{"older_person_id":"otw_1ui_wba_E","younger_person_id":"otw_1ui_wba_C","operator":"lt","scope":"siblings","older_ordinal":null,"younger_ordinal":null}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-050","chapter_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household","source_id":"s-songshu-050-hu-fan-household-ws2371899","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household:p001","quote":"子隆世嗣，官至西陽太守。隆世卒，子乾秀嗣。藩庶子六十人，多不遵法度。藩第十四子遵世，為臧質寧遠參軍，去職還家，與孔熙先同逆謀，太祖以藩功臣，不欲顯其事，使江州以他事收殺之。二十四年，藩第十六子誕世、第十七子茂世率羣從二百餘人攻破郡縣，殺太守桓隆之、令諸葛和之，欲奉庶人義康。值交州刺史檀和之至豫章，討平之。誕世兄車騎參軍新興太守景世、景世弟寶世，詣廷尉歸罪，並徙遠州。乾秀奪國。世祖初，徙者並得還。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household:p001:m0096","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household:p001:m0164"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"誕世稱景世為兄。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"a-song050-baoshi-jingshi","subject_person_id":"otw_1ui_wba_F","object_person_id":"otw_1ui_wba_E","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"景世弟寶世","relative_birth_order":{"older_person_id":"otw_1ui_wba_E","younger_person_id":"otw_1ui_wba_F","operator":"lt","scope":"siblings","older_ordinal":null,"younger_ordinal":null}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-050","chapter_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household","source_id":"s-songshu-050-hu-fan-household-ws2371899","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household:p001","quote":"子隆世嗣，官至西陽太守。隆世卒，子乾秀嗣。藩庶子六十人，多不遵法度。藩第十四子遵世，為臧質寧遠參軍，去職還家，與孔熙先同逆謀，太祖以藩功臣，不欲顯其事，使江州以他事收殺之。二十四年，藩第十六子誕世、第十七子茂世率羣從二百餘人攻破郡縣，殺太守桓隆之、令諸葛和之，欲奉庶人義康。值交州刺史檀和之至豫章，討平之。誕世兄車騎參軍新興太守景世、景世弟寶世，詣廷尉歸罪，並徙遠州。乾秀奪國。世祖初，徙者並得還。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-050-hu-fan-household:p001:m0170","object_person_mention_i